Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第4集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.69,0:00:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:22.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(酒吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(特洛特酒吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得继承他的遗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to carry out his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means hunting down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能猎杀多少凶鬼恶灵杀多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}as many evil sons of bitches as we possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是魔鬼之门  地狱的大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a Devil's Gate, a damn door to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有多确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How certain are you 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.01,0:00:22.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that what you brought back...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是百分百纯粹的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}is 100 percent pure Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那不重要  - 告诉我你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't matter. - Just tell me who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.77,0:00:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想时不时帮帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna help you from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么想帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you wanna help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能帮你救你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could help you save your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1835年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in 1835,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.57,0:00:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔·柯尔特造了把特别的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel Colt made a special gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这枪能杀任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gun can kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚就这样吧  修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all for tonight, Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我送你回车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let me walk you to your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.14,0:01:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝离开我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's not with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪  他当然还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么说  出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would say that? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他帮不了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便他能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he can...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也不肯帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}he won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能在俄亥俄州发现了预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might've found some omens in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无雨闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dry lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.77,0:02:39.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气压骤降\N{\fnArial\fs30}barometric pressure drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令人兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's thrilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有个家伙在教堂里崩了自己的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, some guy blows his head off in a church
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.65,0:02:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一个则在一家消闲品店里发了狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and another goes postal in a hobby shop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后被警察击毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the cops take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是恶魔预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be demonic omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能只是普通的自杀和喜欢拼贴簿的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it could just be a suicide and a psycho scrapbooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  但这是林肯后我们最好的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But it's our best lead since Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.99,0:02:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄亥俄哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where in Ohio?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabethville.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是铁锈地带一个衰败的工厂镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a half-dead factory town in the rust belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南海滩就没有恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a demon or two in South Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  花花公子  下次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Hef, maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:02:59.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进展缓慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到柯尔特枪这样子有点让人难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a little sad seeing the Colt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它现在唯一的用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the only thing it's good for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是研究明白它的原理\N{\fnArial\fs30}is figuring out what makes it tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的原理是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what makes it tick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们要去俄亥俄州看看这些预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we wanna go check out these omens in Ohio...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你下午之前能把那玩意修好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think you can have that thing ready by this afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到那时是杀不了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it won't kill demons by then,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我保证能杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can promise you it'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  走  我们在浪费日光呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on. We're wasting the daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回见  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们如果遇见了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys run into anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么可供保险公司调查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not much left for the insurance company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:52.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是起自杀  我亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a suicide. Saw it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.05,0:03:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这应该很快就能结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this shouldn't take long, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.81,0:03:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪就在那里动手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where Andy did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我几周来第一次见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first time I'd seen him in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以前每周日都来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to come every Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:04.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么时候不再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did he stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概两个月前吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably about two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在其他一切开始变化的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right around the time everything else started to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么变化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说吧  这以前是座让人骄傲的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say this used to be a town you could be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们关心彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}People cared about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪还是唱诗班成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy sang in the choir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有一天  他突然就不再是安迪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one day he just wasn't Andy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被附身了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:31.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钱赌光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gambled away his money,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背着妻子出轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}cheated on his wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁了自己的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroyed his business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:37.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像一个开关被扳动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a switch had flipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父  你认识那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, did you know the man
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在消闲品店里杀人的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who killed those folks in the hobby shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  托尼·珀金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Tony Perkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼·珀金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony Perkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.11,0:04:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他也是有天突然性情大变吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say that his personality suddenly changed one day too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未那么想过  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought about it that way but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟安迪一样  大概是两个月前突然变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the same time as Andy, about two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.87,0:05:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢你抽时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个月前  我们打开了魔鬼之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two months ago, we opened up the Devil's Gate...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:11.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这小镇突然就变成了堕落之城吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of a sudden this town turns into Margaritaville?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝不是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:43.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:45.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是继妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}stepsister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  这是我弟弟  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in. This is my brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:05:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好吗  - 还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you doing? - Not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你俩怎么认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时在上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:05.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是卡纳西的那个梦魔  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was that succubus in Canarsie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  你真该看到那妞的奶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. You should have seen the rack on this broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不得不干掉她  真是悲剧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frigging tragedy when I had to gank her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.07,0:06:13.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  是谁杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Who...? Who killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:16.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我没记错  是我及时救场  你才保住命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I remember your ass was toast until I showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都忘了这家伙多会说笑话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot what a comedian this guy was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.45,0:06:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里奇  我当时就跟你说过  现在再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, Richie, you know, I told you then, I'll tell you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不适合这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not cut out for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会害死自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  温彻斯特  恶语伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}FYI, Winchester. Words hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  现在不方便  亲爱的  回头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not a good time, baby. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这镇上有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you find anything in this town anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  你是指恶魔什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, you mean as in demons and whatnot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不出所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你刚刚那位妹妹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your sister back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她体内绝对有魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She definitely had the devil in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.69,0:06:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她不是恶魔  你明白我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she wasn't no demon. You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教堂男  消闲品店男\N{\fnArial\fs30}church guy, hobby-shop guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我赶到时  他们都死透透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were lunch meat by the time I got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:07:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他们是被附身了  但我无法证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they were possessed, but I can't prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  我们也面临这情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's where we are too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, let's just say that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔是附身了这镇上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}demons are possessing people in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 到处搞事  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you know, raising hell... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但恶魔为什么要崩了自己的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why would a demon blow his brains out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,图好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁坏一具身体  再转攻下一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he wrecks one body, moves to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像开偷来的车兜风\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like taking a stolen car for a joyride.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这镇上还有符合这个特征的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody else left in town fits that profile?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好人突然变渣  还活着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, nice guy turned douche, still breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有特洛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Trotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他原本是扶轮社主席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he used to be head of the rotary club.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后人们说他突然变成了个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then people say he turned bastard all the sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带来了赌博和妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought in the gambling, the hookers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.35,0:07:25.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这整座小镇现在基本都属于他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He practically owns this whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我们可以去哪找他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where we could find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他几小时后就会去他的酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be at his bar in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是说这是座落魄的工厂镇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said this was some boarded-up factory town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少本该是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least it's supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:53.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还等什么  去调研一番吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are we waiting for? Let's do some research.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:31.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里奇  看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复兴缎子衣服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing satin back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去运河街的泰国丝绸看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try Thai Silk. Canal Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的衣服少说也300美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to pay $300 for threads like these, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了  对于我  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, to me? Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"别说了"是多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much is "forget about it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是特洛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Trotter over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:46.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他整晚都坐在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sits there all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别想靠近他  - 我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't touch him. - So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你们怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know about you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我要去找那酒保调查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm gonna do a little investigating with that bartender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和她  我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and her, we got a little
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.19,0:08:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说好稍后一起玩玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}something-something lined up for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不爽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stings, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我去解手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I gotta hit the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,释放下人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release the hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:03.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be back in a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他才不可能泡到那样的姑娘  看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way he gets a girl like that. I mean, look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那屁股能放在五分硬币上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could fit that ass on a nickel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.31,0:09:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就知道你们会找来这里  每个人都不免俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew you boys would find your way here. They all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但您怎么会在这里  神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what are you doing here, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样  神父要去信众所在的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, you go where your flock is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 而且神父喝酒不要钱  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Plus the clergy drinks for free. - True.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.35,0:09:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某个酒保还欠我一次忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a certain bartender owes me a confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这辈子别想了  神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in this lifetime, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你周日最好过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better see your butt on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管有没有硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nickel or no nickel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.11,0:09:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们需要点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I get you boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的招牌酒是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your specialty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很会调飓风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make a mean hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还喝飓风  - 现在喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You drink hurricanes? - I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰  - 雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John. - Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything okay with you? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.05,0:10:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天感觉不太自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not feeling myself today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他睡了我老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slept with my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那混蛋睡了我老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bastard slept with my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手放后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里警察太多了  我们跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many cops here, I say we bolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是被半打啤酒附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only thing possessing him was a sixer of Pabst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the deal, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小镇里的人究竟有没有被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}People in this town getting possessed or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:10:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  或许就真像看上去那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe it is just what it is, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:10:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个人渣小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A town full of scumbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备好拍大头照了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys ready for your mug shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摄影师马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photographer's gonna be here in a few and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你们拍照登在本地报纸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}take your picture for the local paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很荣幸  警官  太让人兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be an honor, officer. What a thrill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里奇呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Richie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个酒保怎么买得起这样的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how's a bartender afford a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父母留给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents left it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不怎么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't come out here much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:33.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非是想单独待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly when I wanna be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里  不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, uh, charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:48.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得找间卧室会更惬意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you wouldn't be more comfortable in a bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者去我的旅馆房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, uh, my motel room?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不说别的  但我有精油\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not for nothing. But, you know, I got oils.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:55.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我有玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  玩具比精油好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, toys trump oils.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己待在这下面不害怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't, uh, get scared down here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟还有个猎人会保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not when I've got a hunter to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你眼前有红肉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize there's red meat within striking distance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.45,0:12:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还得跟里奇说多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times I gotta tell Richie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会害自己惹上麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna get himself in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  你认定他是失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you're assuming he's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他可能只是跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe he just bailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:47.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个可爱的白痴  但他不是懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's a sweet moron, but he's not a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:50.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会就那么跑了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't just bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得去找到他  - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta go find him. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在要去跟踪这个特洛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, I think I'm gonna trail this Trotter guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:12:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他昨晚看我的眼神有点怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about the way he looked at me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这里真有什么古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there is something going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.13,0:13:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打不死恶魔的  如果那是你的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't stop a demon if that's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是合理推测吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it an educated guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我真走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ain't I lucky, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有试枪的靶子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found a subject for a test fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟运气毫无关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:51.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请便  尽管来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}by all means, take your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是要像个怂包似的站在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna stand there like a pantywaist
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是要打...\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are you gonna shoot...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点疼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This smarts a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.05,0:14:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底要不要我帮你修枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do you want me to help you out with that gun or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪恩  - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在没法说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can't talk right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:45.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine. Just
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20分钟后我们酒吧见  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}meet me at the bar in 20 minutes. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:48.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得告诉你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方的每个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}every woman in this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都对你垂涎三尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}they wanna eat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:16.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何人都可能擒住那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody could've tackled that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夺下他的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wrestled the gun away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止他大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prevented mass murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一般每晚收费400美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally, I charge 400 a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你打个五折  我们离开这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we call it an even deuce and get the hell out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:42.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.47,0:15:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小气鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheapskate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是被妓女嫌弃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I just see you strike out with a prostitute?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.06,0:15:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就告诉她我对酒保有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just told her I had a thing for the bartender.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说酒保有空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says the bartender's available?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是跟谁约好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something going with some guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概这么高  穿件运动衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, about yay tall, wears a sweat suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你下班后我们去喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say you and me grab a drink after your shift?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要等呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say, why wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在就能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we can go right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:16:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你可能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我要报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think I'm calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.97,0:17:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 报警  - 擅闯  袭人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cops? - Breaking and entering, assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你麻烦大了  朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a peck of trouble, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我或许能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think I could probably explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 退后  - 钱在保险箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back. - Money's in the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿上走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我得确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gotta be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是什么疯子啊  - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of psycho are you? - God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:28.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可能只是个小误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that this was just a minor misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我...还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about I just...? I just leave, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把这个拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'II,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave this for...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你们愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来女佣今天放假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the maid's day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:15.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你随意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.55,0:18:24.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘了说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot to mention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里奇是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie was a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现我能追踪他手机的定位系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I realized I could track the GPS in his cell phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.77,0:18:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我之前来了一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swung by earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.52,0:18:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好安葬了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave him a proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:41.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总比在一个贱货地下室里发霉好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better than rotting in some skank's basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真扫兴啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that a buzz kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了  妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你要回老家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're going back to where you came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你笑什么  贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you laughing at, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是被困着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:08.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丢东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.45,0:20:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些恶魔嘴巴真贱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you demons have such smart mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我送你回地狱  看你还笑得出不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if you're smiling when I send your ass back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没了你的驱魔书你还能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without your little exorcism book?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记不起来了吗  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a little trouble there, sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想得美  但你好像刚叫了披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, but I think you just ordered a pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你上拉丁语课时该更专心点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you should've paid more attention in Latin class.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你笑个什么劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're smiling about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪都别想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来  你也哪都别想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And apparently, neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  但会有人来救我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I got somebody coming for me and,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他上课时专心听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he did pay attention in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:58.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.12,0:21:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都说他才是你们中聪明的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone says he's the brains of the outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大家  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone? - Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们温家兄弟很有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}you Winchester boys are famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有洛翰那么有名  但是...  - 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not Lohan famous, but, you know. - Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真荣幸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's flattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等萨姆来了  我一定转告他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'll be sure to let Sam know when he gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是他先来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he shows up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.89,0:21:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你以为我是一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you thought I was flying solo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不该低估敌人  迪恩  你可能因此而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't underestimate, Dean. It might be the death of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你怎么瞪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can give me hard eyes all you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.27,0:21:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但事实就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the fact remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能等等看谁先来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just have to wait and see who shows up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是救兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cavalry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是印第安人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the Indians.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:46.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看上去好紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look kind of tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道种保准让你放松的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a sure-fire way to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.13,0:21:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.51,0:21:57.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I get for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:21:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得昨晚跟我一起来的男人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember the guy I was with last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们当时就坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sat right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个扑倒雷吉的大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big hero who jumped on Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.98,0:22:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. The...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.81,0:22:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大英雄  对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big hero, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天见过他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen him around at all today?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧  看情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.90,0:22:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.82,0:22:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这镇上每个人都要钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does everyone here have their hand out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他大概一小时前跟凯茜走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left with Casey about an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.91,0:22:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他们去哪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea where they went?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她家  去研读圣经了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her place, for Bible study.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.12,0:22:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你知道她的地址吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you got an address?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.54,0:22:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我会把同事的地址告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'm gonna give you a coworker's address...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让你过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so can you go over there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个变态偷窥狂似的爽一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get your freaky, peeping-Tom rocks off?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮尔蒙特街和克林顿街街口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corner of Piermont and Clinton.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:56.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放松一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:22:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you kiss my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.99,0:23:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  你是个诗人呢  我都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Dean, you're a poet. I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.45,0:23:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是无法影响此事的结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we won't have any effect on the outcome of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.53,0:23:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如礼貌些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might as well be civil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,礼貌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civil, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀里奇  那叫礼貌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Richie, that was...? That was civil?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他人畜无害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy was harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.67,0:23:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对我掏的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That knife he pulled on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.09,0:23:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去可不"无害"呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't look harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.13,0:23:15.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀又伤不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knife wouldn't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.55,0:23:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  但会损坏这具身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it would damage this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.05,0:23:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯茜的身体这么美\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Casey has such a fine body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想看到它被破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't wanna see it ripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.55,0:23:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有善心的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon with a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.31,0:23:27.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这镇上的好多死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, there's a bunch of dead people in town
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会这么看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.31,0:23:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没扣过扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't pull any triggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.77,0:23:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.73,0:23:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道我做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.31,0:23:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我究竟做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I really did?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.90,0:23:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃了顿午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:39.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.07,0:23:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和特洛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Trotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.07,0:23:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他点了奶酪汉堡  我点了沙拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a cheeseburger. I had a salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.49,0:23:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我指出  他可以挣大钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just pointed out the money that could be made...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只需要经营一些迎合无害恶习的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a few businesses that cater to harmless vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.04,0:23:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特洛特照做了  他们就都来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Trotter built it and, man, did they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.29,0:23:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些所谓的敬神的民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly God-fearing folk,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:57.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深陷在酒精  性爱和赌博里\N{\fnArial\fs30}waist-deep in booze, sex, gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:23:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不需要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely lifted a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.30,0:24:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.05,0:24:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.30,0:24:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要把人类往合适的方向推一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is nudge humans in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.26,0:24:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点威士忌  一个妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some whiskey here, a hooker there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都会笑逐颜开地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they'll walk right into hell
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.18,0:24:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大步走进地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}with big, fat smiles on their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.27,0:24:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们人类就是烂  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kind is corrupt, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.90,0:24:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的意志更坚定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our will is stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.19,0:24:18.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是结局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's how it ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.82,0:24:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那是开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's how it begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.59,0:24:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.49,0:25:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.32,0:25:05.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔夺取世界吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So demons take over?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.49,0:25:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说温顺的人将继承大地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the meek shall inherit the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.12,0:25:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你们圣经上说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to your Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.58,0:25:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是本书  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a book, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.16,0:25:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是每个人都会这么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone would agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.37,0:25:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那是上帝的书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's God's book?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信上帝吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in God, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.59,0:25:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你相信我会感到意外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be surprised if you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.88,0:25:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.76,0:25:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.63,0:25:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么不觉得你和你的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't see how you and your God
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.64,0:25:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}have done such a bang-up job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.93,0:25:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争  种族屠杀  情况还越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}War, genocide, it's only getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.52,0:25:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一个世纪以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, in this past century,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.89,0:25:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们制造的死亡让我们都觉得不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}you people racked up a body count that amazed even us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.81,0:25:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在轮到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.86,0:25:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这次要做好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna do it right this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.49,0:25:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太抱希望  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be hopeful, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.28,0:25:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没获得解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是风\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.71,0:25:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比  是萨姆  我们有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, it's Sam. We got a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.42,0:25:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现了一些硫磺  还找不到迪恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found some sulfur and now I can't find Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.33,0:25:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到后马上联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me as soon as you get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.92,0:26:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  他们没在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. They weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你的改天晚上再爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you gotta catch your jollies another night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.59,0:26:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.13,0:26:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you have a drink...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.55,0:26:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放松一下吧  - 我不想放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and relax? - Yeah, I don't want to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.22,0:26:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这镇上的人是怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with the people in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.06,0:26:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你了  公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.53,0:26:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.49,0:26:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.74,0:26:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以...跟你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I...? Can I talk to you for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.54,0:26:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得天花乱坠  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're piling it pretty high there, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.25,0:26:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不怎么信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I'm buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.83,0:26:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么要撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.67,0:26:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔就会撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.79,0:26:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.13,0:26:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有些是真信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are true believers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.59,0:26:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believers in what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你以为只有人类有更高力量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think humans have an exclusive on a higher power?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.51,0:26:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们有上帝吗  - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have a god? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.14,0:26:52.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.05,0:26:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.89,0:26:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你们的用词  不是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your word, not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.14,0:26:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路西法的本意是"光明使者"  自己去查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer actually means "light bringer." Look it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾是上帝天使中最美的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once, he was the most beautiful of all God's angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但上帝要求他向人类屈膝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But God demanded that he bow down before man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.86,0:27:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他拒绝后  便被上帝驱逐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he refused, God banished him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.57,0:27:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.57,0:27:09.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意向不如你的生物屈膝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you like bowing before lesser creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.74,0:27:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路西法是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's really real?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.16,0:27:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no one's actually seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.95,0:27:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但据说是他把我们变成了这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they say that he made us into what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.04,0:27:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说他会归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they say that he'll return.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.29,0:27:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? And,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.21,0:27:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.04,0:27:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.00,0:27:25.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  我们跟你们真那么不同吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you see? Is my kind really all that different than yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.09,0:27:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, except that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.70,0:27:30.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔是邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, demons are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.93,0:27:33.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类就那么美好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And humans are such a lovable bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.01,0:27:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克·切尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Cheney.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.89,0:27:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是你们的人吗  - 还不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He one of yours? - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.18,0:27:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这么说吧  楼下有给他预留的停车位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just say he's got a parking spot reserved for him downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.94,0:27:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.80,0:27:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it like down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.40,0:27:49.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.40,0:27:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.66,0:27:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.53,0:27:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那笔交易给你定了去那里的单程票\N{\fnArial\fs30}You booked a one-way ticket with that deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.87,0:27:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna like it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.12,0:28:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且看你惹的那些麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um, judging from the trouble you've caused...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.21,0:28:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是别想住总统套房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you'll be getting the presidential suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.71,0:28:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个绝望之坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a pit of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.67,0:28:11.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我们为什么都想来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think we want to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.30,0:28:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那晚那个酒保  凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the bartender the other night, Casey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.97,0:28:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟她熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know her pretty well?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.10,0:28:19.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自她还小时就认识她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since she was in pigtails.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.73,0:28:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, she and my brother, they...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.57,0:28:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}left tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.03,0:28:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.86,0:28:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.49,0:28:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我虽然不赞同  但他们是自愿的成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not that I approve, but they are consenting adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.74,0:28:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.28,0:28:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  你说"哥哥"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, you said "brother."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你俩是保险调查员呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the two of you were insurance investigators.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.12,0:28:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对  我们是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right, well, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.04,0:28:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是家族企业吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a family business. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.84,0:28:48.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, um, so
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去过了凯茜的公寓  但他们不在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to Casey's apartment and they weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.17,0:28:53.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是感觉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I just have this feeling that they...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.84,0:28:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可能有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they might be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么样的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.47,0:28:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.68,0:29:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你  神父  我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, please, Father, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.39,0:29:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道凯茜什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you can tell me about Casey?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.02,0:29:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道她可能去了哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any place she'd go maybe...?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.69,0:29:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  是有个地方  我去拿外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. There is a place. Let me get my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.89,0:29:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  等等  神父  我不想麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait, Father. I don't wanna put you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.40,0:29:09.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.32,0:29:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  如果凯茜真有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, if Casey's really in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.15,0:29:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就没什么好商量的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then there's nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.62,0:29:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.17,0:29:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺有意思的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of funny, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.30,0:29:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我  像一对常人一样坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me sitting here like a couple of regular folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.59,0:29:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  真好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.14,0:29:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点天启的意味\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, in that apocalyptic sort of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.56,0:29:43.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不错  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.27,0:29:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人可不是这么说你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others don't describe you that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.02,0:29:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...你挺可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, you're... You're likable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.40,0:29:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个恶魔喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.69,0:29:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我不知道该怎么回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I don't know how to respond to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.28,0:29:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以说谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.28,0:29:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为救萨姆做的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}That deal you made to save Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.95,0:30:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多其他人为此嘲讽你\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of others would mock you for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.45,0:30:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认为那是软弱或愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}think it was weak or stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.16,0:30:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.21,0:30:11.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实还挺让人觉得解脱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been kind of liberating, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.51,0:30:15.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何必担心未来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's the point in worrying about a future...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.09,0:30:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你反正也没有未来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you don't have one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.68,0:30:20.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a year to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.51,0:30:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.56,0:30:23.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.77,0:30:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都不吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.39,0:30:26.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.48,0:30:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保险调查员啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So insurance investigating?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.28,0:30:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢这工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You enjoy the work?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.99,0:30:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah, I
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.53,0:30:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢能帮助他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}like being able to help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.70,0:30:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑过做别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think about doing anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.04,0:30:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.83,0:30:46.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.59,0:30:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你似乎很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem like a pretty smart kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你是个做领头羊的料子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, I see you out in front of the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.54,0:30:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能做大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do some great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.89,0:31:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.01,0:31:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢我的工作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like doing what I'm doing, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.26,0:31:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  那是你的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.31,0:31:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does, um...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.56,0:31:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪恩吗  - 对  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - Yeah, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.61,0:31:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他经常惹麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he find trouble often?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.94,0:31:14.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.90,0:31:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩是惹过不少麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean finds his fair share.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.90,0:31:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好他还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a good thing he has you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.03,0:31:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}His brother's keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.29,0:31:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呦  迪恩  我要是不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Dean, if I didn't know better,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.96,0:31:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会以为你眼里有淫欲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that was lust in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.63,0:31:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样倒也可以消磨时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that would be one way to spend the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.18,0:31:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得你早上不会尊敬我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think you'd respect me in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.85,0:31:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.51,0:31:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在也不怎么尊敬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hey, I barely respect you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.64,0:31:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能问你个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.51,0:31:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知无不言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an open book.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.65,0:31:57.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大门开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the gate opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.74,0:32:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔大军被放了出来  现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon army was let out. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.99,0:32:03.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没看到你们有什么大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not seeing a big honking plan here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.74,0:32:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本是有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.62,0:32:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚撒色是个暴君\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azazel was a tyrant...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.50,0:32:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他把我们团结在了一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he held us all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚撒色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azazel?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.58,0:32:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你以为他的朋友也喊他"黄眼恶魔"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think his friends just called him "Yellow Eyes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.71,0:32:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也有名字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.84,0:32:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了他后  计划瓦解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you did him in, it all fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.34,0:32:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.01,0:32:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  没有指挥链吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, no chain of command?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.26,0:32:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.18,0:32:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.81,0:32:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆本该成为大统领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam was supposed to be the Grand Pooh Bah,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.89,0:32:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带领军队  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}lead the big army. But
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.10,0:32:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他并没有承担这个责任  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}he hasn't exactly stepped up to the plate, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.69,0:32:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.01,0:32:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又提上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again with God?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.82,0:32:43.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这是好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.74,0:32:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是一片混乱  全线作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you've got chaos, a war without a front.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.16,0:32:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数百个恶魔  都想争权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds of demons, all jockeying for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.25,0:32:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都在争夺王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All fighting for the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.41,0:32:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大部分都想灭了你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of them gunning for your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.17,0:32:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.50,0:33:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本是打算追随萨姆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ready to follow Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.23,0:33:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.61,0:33:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.32,0:33:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.08,0:33:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去那边看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.29,0:33:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 萨姆  - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.87,0:33:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  这里  地下室坍塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, down here! The basement caved in!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.08,0:33:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  撑住了  我们就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hey, hold on, okay? We're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.05,0:33:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有谁来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's "we"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.59,0:33:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟神父一起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here with the Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.09,0:33:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.54,0:34:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.34,0:34:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道我们...  - 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you know where we...? - Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.80,0:34:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了  快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the man. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.70,0:34:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.94,0:35:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.52,0:35:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.94,0:35:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在地狱里走了个来回  毫不夸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been to hell and back. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.44,0:35:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.30,0:35:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别杀他  我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kill him. Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.58,0:35:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.76,0:35:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.24,0:36:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么看  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you think, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.54,0:36:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这里做的事  你觉得改变什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what we did here. Do you think it made a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.66,0:36:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少了两个需要担心的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two less demons to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.92,0:36:25.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不算没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.79,0:36:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但特洛特还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Trotter's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.88,0:36:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人不归我们管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans ain't our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.88,0:36:33.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  但你觉得情况会改变吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But you think anything's really gonna change?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.68,0:36:35.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这些人的确只想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe these people do just wanna
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.05,0:36:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}really destroy themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.76,0:36:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这场战争我们的确必输无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it is a losing battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.48,0:36:42.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你还是那恶魔女的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you or that demon girl talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.23,0:36:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.81,0:36:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔死了  它附身的辣妹也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon is dead. And so is that hot girl it was possessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.03,0:36:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, had to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.19,0:36:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆是想救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam was saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.28,0:36:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  但你没看到  鲍比  他好冷酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But you didn't see it, Bobby. He was cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.12,0:36:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.20,0:36:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.95,0:37:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在怀俄明州  有那么一小会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in Wyoming, uh, there was this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.54,0:37:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄眼恶魔对我说了些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow Eyes said something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.21,0:37:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.01,0:37:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}That maybe when...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.09,0:37:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆复活时...不管他是去了哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam came back from... Well, wherever. That
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.51,0:37:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许复活的他不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe he came back different.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.47,0:37:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different how?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.27,0:37:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  不管怎样  听上去不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Whatever it was, it didn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.14,0:37:25.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think...?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.65,0:37:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我弟弟是不是有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think something's wrong with my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.69,0:37:32.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.07,0:37:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔都撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.53,0:37:36.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆肯定没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Sam's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.24,0:37:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.54,0:37:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.84,0:37:54.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.43,0:37:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还没来得及庆祝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't even had a chance to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.47,0:38:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  那你自己庆祝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, you can celebrate without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.30,0:38:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是要对我撒气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna get all pouty on me now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.56,0:38:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.02,0:38:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天杀了俩恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed two demons today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.23,0:38:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  或许你不在乎  但我也杀了俩人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, maybe you don't care, but I killed two humans too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.73,0:38:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  你清楚恶魔附身人类的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you know what happens when demons piggyback humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.94,0:38:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类会被利用得身心俱疲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They leave them rode hard and put up wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.32,0:38:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那俩极可能会死得缓慢又痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chances are those two would've died a slow, sticky death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.12,0:38:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你八成是帮他们解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably did them a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.45,0:38:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮他们解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did them a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.96,0:38:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个冷酷的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a cold bitch, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.50,0:38:29.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本冷酷贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and this cold bitch
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.54,0:38:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可救了你好几次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has saved your ass a couple of times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.38,0:38:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是尊重我点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some respect might be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.21,0:38:36.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.76,0:38:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你希望我帮你为迪恩解围\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want me to help you out with Dean and his little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗  你总拿那个吊着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, you keep dangling that,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.47,0:38:43.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但据我所知  迪恩还是要下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but last I checked Dean's still going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.64,0:38:45.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凡事急不得  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in its own time, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.52,0:38:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们要等价交换  我们身处战争中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a quid pro quo here. We're in a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.56,0:38:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  但不知为何  你站在我们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. But for some reason you're fighting on our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.40,0:38:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  这是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me, why is that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.15,0:38:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go screw yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.90,0:38:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就因为这个  - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that's why. - I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.74,0:38:58.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要对你解释我的行为  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to justify my actions to you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.32,0:38:59.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不要我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't want my help...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.62,0:39:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.87,0:39:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then give me the gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.24,0:39:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把它给愿意用它的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll pass it on to someone who will use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.37,0:39:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我就拿它崩了你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll just use it on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.75,0:39:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊  如果那让你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, if that makes you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.00,0:39:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这可帮不了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna do much for Dean, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.76,0:39:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.98,0:39:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.77,0:39:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不会轻松的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't be easy, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.98,0:39:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得做一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to do things
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.02,0:39:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有违你温柔天性的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that go against that gentle nature of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.86,0:39:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还会有附带伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.66,0:39:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这无法避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.78,0:39:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不非得喜欢那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.45,0:39:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.74,0:39:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你如果喜欢就不是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be Sam if you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.04,0:39:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但好的一面是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But on the bright side...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.42,0:39:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会陪伴你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.67,0:39:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肩膀上的小堕落天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little fallen angel on your shoulder.

